# Every pull request automatically requests review from the maintainer.
#
# GitHub never requests review from the PR's own author, so this affects contributions from
# other people without getting in the maintainer's way on their own branches.
#
# Deliberately NOT wired into the branch ruleset as "require Code Owner review": with a single
# code owner, that setting blocks the maintainer's own PRs, because GitHub will not accept a
# self-approval to satisfy it.

